'''Flametal Mace''' is the sixth one-handed [[Clubs|club]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Ashlands-tier weapons, the Flametal Mace can be upgraded to one of the following three variants using gemstones:

* {{Item link|Bloodgeon}} ([[Bloodstone]])
* {{Item link|Storm Star}} ([[Iolite]])
* {{Item link|Klossen}} ([[Jade]])

An upgraded Flametal Mace will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using gemstones.

